It is twelve o'clock, and I am done at the café.
My volunteer shift on Saturday morning is always busy, but cozy.
Now I am off work.
The weather is lovely today.
It has become really mild and lovely.
The sun is shining, and it is much milder than last week.
I feel like treating myself a little.
I walk down the big pedestrian street.
There are a lot of people in the city today.
People are smiling and enjoying the good weather.
I would like to buy some new clothes.
I am looking for some lighter spring clothes.
Maybe a nice new spring jacket and a shirt.
I look through the window of a large clothing store.
They have clothes in many beautiful spring colors.
I decide to go in there.
I am looking forward to trying some of the things on.
I hope that I can find the right size.
